IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STATUS-FALLBACK-03.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT INFILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUTFILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD INFILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 PAYLOAD PIC X(6) VALUE "UNSET".
FD OUTFILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-TEXT PIC X(3).
05 OUT-MARK PIC X(1) VALUE "R".
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2) VALUE "00".
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2) VALUE "00".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
OPEN INPUT INFILE
OPEN OUTPUT OUTFILE
READ INFILE AT END
    MOVE "BLANK" TO PAYLOAD
    MOVE "E" TO OUT-MARK
END-READ
MOVE PAYLOAD TO OUT-TEXT
WRITE OUT-REC
DISPLAY IN-STATUS "/" OUT-STATUS
CLOSE INFILE
CLOSE OUTFILE
STOP RUN.
